        "TileImage": "$($repository 176723fd-85d8-466e-b35f-2f045d69eef9).Image",
        "Description": "47,\r\rI have heard enough of your complaining about the size and scale of Ambrose island- my favorite vacation spot. For this mission you must go to various parts of the island and kill some locals (and non-locals) that have built their measly huts on my favorite spots on the island. Beware- the locals have become quite fond of their homes- it will not  be easy to kill them without repercussions. \r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
